o What ist SortArea
  -----------------
   
  SortArea is a tool that reads the files FILE:area.bbs or MSG:area.bbs,
  and  after sorting the Areanumbers it writes back a file called 
  FILE:area.bbs.sorted (or MSG:area.bbs.sorted)

o Usage
  -----

  copy SortArea into a directory added in your path command.

  if you call SortArea without any parameter you get the 
  usage lines. 

  Usage :

  SortArea -m    - sorts the MSG:area.bbs file

  SortArea -f    - sorts the FILE:area.bbs file
   
  after some seconds you find in your FILE: (or MSG:) path
  a file called area.bbs.sorted

  Now you can move your original Area.bbs file in a save place
  and then rename the "area.bbs.sorted" file to "area.bbs"


